+
+### Singleton constructor injectivity
+
+- Extension:
+  `iCons(C, .IntSeq) ==K iCons(D, .IntSeq) => C ==Int D
+  [simplification]`.
+- Class: derived lemma.
+- Semantic role: normalizes equality of the one-character strings produced by
